51 - 60 of 1075 Press Releases

Dec 21, 2017
It has made significant improvements to the processing of CSS styles and HTML to PDF conversion feature. It has improved z-index positioning algorithms so setting position property of an element to "absolute" value will place element correctly.

Dec 20, 2017
It enables developers to generate QR coded barcode with setting its version number. This release also fixes several exceptions that were reported by Aspose valued customer, such as Process of setting license has been improved.

Dec 18, 2017
It has enhanced the way of exporting VSDM drawing to SVG format, as the result, the shading problem of shapes has been decreased. This release also includes some important enhancements and bug fixes, such as VSDX to PDF export & many more.

Dec 14, 2017
The major development in this release is the support to generate QR coded barcode with version setting. This release also supports enhanced process of recognizing Code128 and OneD coded barcode. Improved speed and quality of 1D barcode recognition.

Dec 13, 2017
Aspose is pleased to announce the first public release of Aspose.Cells for JavaScript via Java. It enables Developers to Create, Manipulate or Convert Excel Spreadsheets without requiring Microsoft Excel inside JavaScript Apps.

Dec 11, 2017
It has introduced some new features such as Render comments when saving Presentation into Image and Implementing End Paragraph Run Properties for Paragraph. There are some important enhancements & issues have been fixed.

Dec 07, 2017
It has introduced some new features such as setting Color Type and Compression Type for JPEG Images, Color replacement in PSD layers, Saving SVG with Fonts embedded or Exported, Managing resources while saving Metafileas SVG, Convert ODG Files etc.

Dec 06, 2017
This new release of has introduced Binary Classification for better OCR recognition. This release also implemented OCR network in Player under our main OCR component to achieve better performance. Furthermore Improved overall performance of API.

Dec 04, 2017
Special Holidays Offer on Aspose.Total, Get 25% off Aspose.Total for .NET, Java, C++, Android via Java, Android via Xamarin, iOS via Xamarin, Mac via Xamarin, SharePoint, SSRS and JasperReports, New Product Launched known as Aspose.Pdf for C++& more.

Nov 30, 2017
This release supports the functionality to generate databar coded barcode with segments per row. This functionality allows to adjust the amount of information that the code will generate per (each) row. It improved recognizing barcode from image.

