<item>
<title>Re: [FAN SPEED] FAN DON'T DECREASE RPMs AFTER CLOSING ANY GAME</title>
<link>https://community.amd.com/t5/pc-drivers-software/rx580-fan-speed-doesn-t-decrease-after-gaming/m-p/266530#M79138</link>
<description><HTML><HEAD></HEAD><BODY><P>EDIT &gt;&gt; After I restore settings and apply TEMP CONFIGURATION in a GAME PERFIL (left Global perfil in default and config temps only in game perfil), works.<BR />After i quit the game, FAN go to ZERO!<BR />Probably that's bug will be resolved only after a OS clean installation</P><P></P><P>XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</P><P></P><P>I can understand english, but I've difficult to write, maybe I'm not made me understandable.</P><P></P><P>Before the problem appears, although in the BIOS ( I copy BIOS and used Pollaris BIOS Editting to see) the target is 75C,</P><P>in 52C FAN start and 50C FAN stop. How i set the max temp to 65C, the GPU never exceeded 65C~70C.</P><P>that it: 52C FAN ON &gt;&gt; UP to 65~67C, exit game, down to -50C fan OFF</P><P></P><P>Now, When i change target to other value than 75C in RADEON SETTING, FAN settings changes to manual itself, just like the print.</P><P>I try put exactly how you ask, but when i put target = 40, fan setting changes itself to manual. Temp respect the configured limit,</P><P>never exceeded 65C, but after that FAN rotation not go down...</P><P></P><P>See in video : <A href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owaTM0oHeJs" title="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owaTM0oHeJs">RADEON SETTINGS _ ERROR - YouTube</A></P><P></P><P>I already try clean instalation with DDU and I used CCLEANER to clean WindownsReg.</P><P>I left the default settings in RADEON SETTINGS</P><P>- Start the GAME, 52C FAN START</P><P>- GPU get 75C.. 80C</P><P>- RPM encreasses</P><P>- exit game</P><P>- RPM remais, even whit GPU temp now in 40C</P><P></P><P></P><P>I Try changes the BIOS ( GPU have DUAL BIOS)</P></BODY></HTML></description>
