It seems the target is supposed to be added to 'cluster_members' on line 360
https://github.com/oracle/weblogic-deploy-tooling/blob/3058d27259e74577a84a8ae0e0acd071d79553bd/core/src/main/python/wlsdeploy/tool/util/target_helper.py#L360
but a call to 'add' is used instead of 'append', resulting in an AttributeError.


Fix will be included in the next release. WIP


