What would be the HTML code to achieve this?

ASSISTANT: To achieve this, you can use JavaScript to dynamically generate the personalized greeting message for your boss. Here's an example of how you can do this:
```html

Personalized Greeting Message


 // Get the current date
 var date = new Date();
 var currentDate = date.toDateString();
 // Get your boss's name
 var bossName = "John Doe"; // replace with your boss's name
 // Create the personalized greeting message
 var greetingMessage = "Hello " + bossName + ", today is " + currentDate + ".";
 // Display the greeting message on the page
 document.getElementById("greeting").innerHTML = greetingMessage;
 
```
