VS Bank" received the award in the nomination "The most reliable bank

October 26, 2016

"VS Bank" was awarded the prize in a special nomination "The most reliable bank in Ukraine" within the VIII All-Ukrainian competition "Bank of the Year - 2016", which was organized by the specialized International Financial Club "Banker" ( Kyiv).

Ceremony of awarding the winners in different nominations held on October 26, 2016 on the basis of estimates of the organizing committee of the competition, leading experts, regulators, media partners and the International Financial Club "Banker".

Determining the winners was based on survey data of Ukrainian banks; results of surveys conducted by sociological services - partners of the magazine "The Banker"; opinions of authoritative experts of the National Bank of Ukraine, Ukrainian Banks Association; Data from Ukrainian rating agencies, business press of Ukraine.

Findings of magazine "The Banker", based on the analysis of qualitative indicators of Ukrainian banks: transparency, accountability, reliability, reputation and professionalism, were also taken into account. The event was attended by leading banks Ukraine, as well as domestic insurance companies.

Recognition of "VS Bank" in this competition confirmed its stable and reliable position in the difficult current conditions, its financial stability and credibility within the financial community and trust among customers.

