"Snow?" "It's sort of like white, lumpy, rain." --Gilligan's IslandIm trying to assign a decimal value of 1 to a variable if a check box is checked but I having trouble getting it to work. Here is my code:
decimal nitrodsgn;
decimal lnitro;
decimal unitro;
if (nitrogenLowerCheckBox.Checked)
lnitro = 1;
if (nitrogenUpperCheckBox.Checked)
unitro = 1;
nitrodsgn = (lnitro + unitro)

  • 2 Contributors
  • 1 Reply
