The `create_shopping_list` method creates a new shopping list with a given name and adds it to the app's list of shopping lists. The `switch_shopping_list` method takes a name and returns the shopping list with that name, or `None` if it doesn't exist. The `add_item_to_shopping_list` method takes a shopping list name and an item, finds the corresponding shopping list, and adds the item to its list of items.
